WEBVTT

00:00:00.441 --> 00:00:04.338
Journey twenty-seven: meet Jubilee on the marketing site.

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:09.056
Jubilee is still launching soon, and the owner has not yet decided to

00:00:09.056 --> 00:00:13.773
open it. So this run did the part that does not wait on launch: every

00:00:13.773 --> 00:00:18.628
criterion of the marketing page, the pitch film and the site's delivery

00:00:18.628 --> 00:00:20.337
now has a behaviour spec.

00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:25.895
A visitor opens the marketing site. The top bar and the opening say

00:00:25.895 --> 00:00:30.599
Launching soon, and beside the heading stands a preview of the app.

00:00:31.409 --> 00:00:36.338
This visitor uses the keyboard. Tab moves through the top bar and the

00:00:36.338 --> 00:00:41.410
opening to the film's play button. Enter plays the film from the start,

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.481
and the film takes the focus.

00:00:44.187 --> 00:00:48.952
The sound is off. The narration is still readable, because the captions

00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:53.449
are part of the picture. A new spec reads the caption box under the

00:00:53.449 --> 00:00:58.215
picture at a line in each chapter, and was first seen failing against a

00:00:58.215 --> 00:00:59.691
film without captions.

00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:04.526
Because the film has the focus, the browser's own controls answer the

00:01:04.526 --> 00:01:08.420
keyboard: Space pauses it. Tab goes through those controls to the

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.733
chapters, and Enter on Finding someone you can trust plays the film from

00:01:12.733 --> 00:01:15.728
twenty-one seconds, marked as the current chapter.

00:01:16.429 --> 00:01:20.683
Straight after the film, the page states the mission, word for word:

00:01:20.683 --> 00:01:25.125
Abiding in Jesus and for love of Him, Jubilee equips Christian business

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:29.317
people in Toronto to prosper with purpose and resource His Kingdom.

00:01:30.019 --> 00:01:35.238
Every heading reads as one sentence to a screen reader, and its second

00:01:35.238 --> 00:01:40.607
part is set in the accent colour. That criterion had no spec before; now

00:01:40.607 --> 00:01:41.203
it does.

00:01:41.905 --> 00:01:46.378
Tab reaches every link, button and field of the page in reading order,

00:01:46.378 --> 00:01:50.787
twenty-eight stops from Skip to content to the last button, and every

00:01:50.787 --> 00:01:52.321
stop shows a focus ring.

00:01:53.024 --> 00:01:57.637
This visitor prefers reduced motion. Watch the film jumps to the film

00:01:57.637 --> 00:02:02.316
instead of scrolling smoothly, and pressing play gives way to the film

00:02:02.316 --> 00:02:03.920
at once, without a zoom.

00:02:04.621 --> 00:02:09.610
And on a device set to dark, the page stays in its light theme, cream

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:12.430
paper and ink type, as the design asks.

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:16.117
Specs now hold it on a light device and a dark one.

00:02:17.082 --> 00:02:21.882
Each new spec was seen failing against a broken page before it was

00:02:21.882 --> 00:02:26.754
relied on. The whole behaviour suite passes, with the parity specs.

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:32.270
What is left waits on the owner. On the day the owner decides to open

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:36.926
Jubilee, the journey twenty-seven prompt brings back the links to the

00:02:36.926 --> 00:02:41.312
app from one configured address. Until then the journey stands at

00:02:41.312 --> 00:02:42.662
ninety-five percent.
